color-theme: biotechnology

=== layout: title-slide

# Lecture 05C

## Biotechnology: Theranos
## Dr. Neil Voss
## Oct 1, 2026

=== layout: one-panel

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Compare product claims with the scientific evidence needed to support them.
- Explain the roles of independent testing, oversight, and whistleblowers.
- Recognize warning signs in the Theranos story.
- Apply these lessons to your own biotechnology proposal.

=== layout: one-panel

