@body

- Have you heard of Theranos or Elizabeth Holmes before today?

- [A. Yes, I have been following the story closely]{color=red}
- [B. Yes, I know the basic story]{color=orange}
- [C. Yes, I had heard of it, but did not know many details]{color=orange}
- [D. Not really, I maybe heard something in passing]{color=green}
- [E. No, never heard of them]{color=blue}

